      "cooked": "<p>Hi all,</p>\n<p>Apologies if this is covered elsewhere, I only just got the game and am still getting to grips with it, but what happens when the Major or Minor Power deck has become empty - do you shuffle the discard pile to create a new deck, or can you just not gain any more power cards? I was assuming the former as that's what usually happens in these sort of games, but as it doesn't appear to be covered in the manual I wasn't sure.</p>\n<p>Thanks for any help.</p>",
